{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
octopkg-tui runs as a regular user and raises privileges only for the
package operations, through doas(1) (the default) or sudo(8):

  pkg install doas

and, in /usr/local/etc/doas.conf, for example:

  permit persist :wheel cmd /usr/local/sbin/pkg
  permit persist :wheel cmd /sbin/bectl

To use sudo instead, run octopkg-tui --elevator=sudo, or add
"elevator=sudo" to ~/.config/octopkg-tui/config.

For the default Nerd Font icons, set the terminal font to a Nerd Font,
such as JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono (pkg install nerd-fonts-jetbrainsmono),
or use --icons=unicode or --icons=ascii.
EOM
}
